&lt;p&gt;What if technology allowed us to push the boundaries and take sports experiences to new levels? That&#39;s exactly our goal at Decathlon Digital! We are a team of 5,000+ experts in software engineering, product management, data, cloud, and cybersecurity, distributed across Paris, Lille, and Amsterdam. Together, we are creating the largest digital sports platform, leveraging tech innovation from design to value chain optimization, connected experiences and product second life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Changing the game for good&lt;/strong&gt;. We are in this for the love of sports. And like everything we love, we want it to last. That’s why we are embarking on a journey to create a more sustainable tech model, reducing our direct environmental impact while maintaining a safe, diverse, and inclusive space for all our people to learn and thrive together. Team up with us to design the digital future of sports.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;The role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tavily, part of Nebius, is the web access layer for AI agents. Over two million developers use us, and our customers include Fortune 500 companies running agents in production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vertical search is where we combine public sources with premium vertical data and shape the result into a product for a specific use case. This role owns that layer end to end. You decide which industries and use cases we productize. With the data team, you find and evaluate the public and premium data providers behind each one. You shape the product surface that sits on top.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will sit with customers in these industries, learn how they actually work, and turn their needs and pain points into clear specs. You will build with engineering, ship it, and make sure go-to-market knows how to sell it. You own the outcome, not just the handoff: from the first market call through to adoption and revenue.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The hard part is choosing. There are more verticals worth building than we can build, and the difference between a good year and a wasted one is knowing which ones to invest in and which to walk away from, even when a large customer is asking for another.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In your first year, we expect you to know our top use cases better than anyone here, ship a product built for one of them that customers will pay more for, and have a defensible view of what comes next.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on senior IC role with real ownership. You will work within a small PM team reporting to the Director of Product, alongside engineering, research, data, and go-to-market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;Your responsibilities will include:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the vertical roadmap. You decide where we invest, what we ship for each, and when a vertical is not worth it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape the product surface on top of the data, so a customer gets something built for their job.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Find and evaluate the data behind each vertical, across public sources and paid providers, and decide what is worth investing in.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sit with customers in these industries until you understand their workflow, then turn that into specs engineering can build.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set what a good answer looks like in each use case, working with our evaluation team, who own how we measure it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with customer success to learn what customers ask us for and what makes them leave.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the search owner on how results should be ranked and shaped for each use case.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;We expect you to have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of product management experience, with a meaningful portion in search, data, or industry-specific AI products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building products for a specific industry or use case, combined with enough technical depth to work directly on the data underneath: where it comes from, how good it is, and what it takes to make it usable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of real customer discovery: you have gone deep on how a particular kind of team works, and shipped something because of what you found.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in API-first or developer-platform businesses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of LLMs, AI agents, and how search and retrieval systems fit into agentic workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A technical background, through a degree in computer science or engineering or equivalent hands-on experience, with the ability to engage deeply with technical architecture and tradeoffs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to influence and align cross-functional stakeholders without formal authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;It will be an added bonus if you have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Domain experience in market intelligence, news, financial research, or another data-heavy industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background at a data provider, enrichment vendor, market intelligence platform, or vertical search company, or experience building vertical data products in-house.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience evaluating and working with external data providers, including judging quality and negotiating what you actually need.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leadership experience in a high-growth technology company, especially post-acquisition or startup-within-a-larger-org environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;The role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tavily, part of Nebius, is the web access layer for AI agents. Over two million developers use us, and our customers include Fortune 500 companies running agents in production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We build and run our own index. That means we own the hard problems directly: crawl coverage at scale, freshness, cost per query, and the quality of what comes back. This role owns that infrastructure as a product.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When an agent asks a question, the answer has to be relevant, fresh, fast, and affordable. Those four things pull against each other, and someone has to decide which one gives. That is you. You will set what good means for each use case we serve and the bar a change has to clear before it ships, working closely with our evaluation team, who own how we measure it. You will also shape where our index goes next: what it needs to cover, how fresh it needs to be, and what it has to be good at.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The most open part of the job is what comes next. Search is being rebuilt for a consumer that is not a person. Agents do not want one result page, they want to break a problem apart, run many retrievals, and decide what to do next. That changes what search infrastructure should look like, and part of your job is to have a view on where ours should go.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The hard part is deciding what good enough means. Perfect coverage, perfect freshness, and low cost cannot all be true at once, and the person in this seat is the one who has to make that call for each use case and defend it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In your first year, we expect you to set a clear quality bar for our search products that the team builds against, have a real influence on where our index goes next, and bring us a point of view on where search infrastructure is heading.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on senior IC role with real ownership, reporting to the Director of Product. You will work day to day with our search engineering and research teams, with the evaluation team, and with customer success, who bring us quality feedback from real accounts every week. Our search engineers are deeply experienced in large-scale retrieval, and the product team is small, so you will argue your case directly with the people building it. That only works if you have built at this scale yourself.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;Your responsibilities will include:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the quality bar and release criteria for search: what good means per use case, and what a change has to clear before it ships. Our evaluation team owns the measurement, and you work closely with them on what to measure and why.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the depth, latency, and cost tradeoffs across our search products, and make them explicit and defensible.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape the direction of our index: what it needs to cover, how fresh it needs to be, and what quality bar it has to meet.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a point of view on where search infrastructure is going as agents, rather than people, become the main consumer, and turn that into a roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Know how we compare to the alternatives customers evaluate, and drive the work that closes the gaps that matter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with customer success and directly with customers to understand where our results fall short in real workflows, and turn that into quality priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the data and vertical product owners on what our corpus needs to contain and how results should be shaped per industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;We expect you to have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of product management experience, with a meaningful portion spent on high-scale search or ranking systems: web search, feed ranking at a large social platform, or a large ad engine.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A background as an engineer, ML engineer, or researcher on a production system in one of those areas. This is a requirement rather than a preference. You will be making tradeoff calls alongside senior search engineers, and you need to have built something at that scale yourself.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct experience shipping a search or ranking change end to end, including how it was evaluated and what happened after it shipped.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong data foundation: you can design an experiment, read eval results critically, and tell a real quality improvement from noise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product judgment to match the technical depth: you can decide what to build and what to leave, and defend it to both engineers and customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of LLMs, AI agents, and how retrieval fits into agentic workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with ambiguity, moving between strategy and execution without losing the thread.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to influence and align cross-functional stakeholders without formal authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;It will be an added bonus if you have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Depth in information retrieval, NLP, or applied machine learning beyond what the role requires.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with index tiering, sharding, freshness pipelines, or cost-per-query optimisation at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with hybrid retrieval, semantic and lexical search, re-ranking, or human evaluation programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in API-first or developer-platform businesses running both self-serve and enterprise motions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a high-growth technology company, especially post-acquisition or startup-within-a-larger-org environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Enterprise UX practice at HelloFresh is a cross-functional team that brings physical and digital product and service experiences to life through strategic research, service design, prototyping, and storytelling. We are dedicated to transforming enterprise ways of working by applying structured methods like Definition Sprints, Service Blueprinting, and AS-IS and TO-BE mapping, creating meaningful &amp;amp; effective enterprise experiences to shape the future of HelloFresh’s Supply Chain.&lt;br&gt;As a Senior Service Designer, you will leverage your research and service design expertise to shape compelling visions for both product and process improvements. You will deeply investigate current ways of working—identifying key data archetypes, mapping AS-IS states, and collaboratively defining desired TO-BE workflows. Your insights will identify the most impactful opportunities for investment. You will closely collaborate with product, engineering, users and operational stakeholders to design, prototype, and validate scalable solutions aligned with our Enterprise Design System.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About the Domain&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The wider Food Systems Alliance owns technology that enables a lean and sustainable procurement process from Suppliers to HelloFresh facilities and improves customer experience with accurate ingredient data flow and optimal ingredient quality. Optimising cost of ingredients, providing customers with the freshest and best ingredients, and enabling buying decisions that reduce excess stock and other forms of inventory waste are just some of the focus areas for this alliance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Conduct and lead&lt;/strong&gt; strategic Definition Sprints to uncover user needs, validate hypotheses, and collaboratively define clear next steps for design and development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Map&lt;/strong&gt; current (AS-IS) enterprise processes and systems, identifying pain points and opportunities, then collaboratively design optimized (TO-BE) processes, particularly within the Food Systems alliance&amp;nbsp; - the cluster that takes care of supply chain management topics within Hello Fresh..&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner and inspire&lt;/strong&gt; other enterprise designers to excel in service design and prototyping, nurturing growth within the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deeply understand&lt;/strong&gt; the user journeys and workflows of Recipe Developers, Menu Planners, and Buyers, building strong stakeholder relationships to advocate effectively for these users.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop and align&lt;/strong&gt; design concepts and prototypes with the Enterprise Design System to ensure scalability and consistency across enterprise tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Form collaborative partnerships&lt;/strong&gt; with POs, engineers, and researchers, using influence to elevate UX solutions and challenge broader assumptions within internal product teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentor and coach&lt;/strong&gt; designers in creating user experiences demonstrating pride in craft, clarity, and effectiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create&lt;/strong&gt; UX/UI flows and experiences that elegantly address complex enterprise problems with delightful, user-centric solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Facilitate&lt;/strong&gt; clear communication across teams, leveraging structured storytelling methods to amplify your impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Above all, we are looking for people who will&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;make HelloFresh&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;better.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We believe there are many different ways of developing skills and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don’t “tick all the boxes” but think you’d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of product design experience, particularly within enterprise or B2B contexts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record in applying structured service design methodologies such as Definition Sprints, AS-IS/TO-BE mapping, and Service Blueprinting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Additional experience leading projects, mentoring, or directly managing design team members.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A portfolio demonstrating impactful, user-centered enterprise experiences and a high level of craft.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in visual design, interaction design, UX writing, and UI design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mastery of Figma and familiarity with relevant prototyping and service design tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills in English, capable of articulating complex concepts clearly to diverse stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elevate your lifestyle! Join one of Europe&#39;s fastest-growing tech powerhouses in a dynamic phase of expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Immerse yourself in a diverse global community of 90+ nationalities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy a competitive compensation package that goes beyond the norm, with perks like a HelloFresh- subsidized Pension Scheme, Berlin relocation support, and a Hybrid working model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevate your lifestyle with exclusive discounts on your weekly HelloFresh box and office meals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Invest in your growth with a German language learning budget, and access to the HelloFresh Academy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plus, we&#39;ve got your well-being covered with mental health support, transportation perks, and working-parent-friendly benefits. From our 24/7 gym access,wellbeing platforms like Headspace and Spill, to sabbatical leave options, HelloFresh is not just a workplace; it&#39;s a lifestyle of perks and possibilities!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#DESIGN&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;L&#39;équipe Data Platform de DECATHLON recherche ses futur-e-s Développeur-se-s Full Stack basé·e·s à Lille/Paris.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Au cœur de l’entité Decathlon Digital, nous recherchons nos futur.es Développeur·se·s&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Full Stack &lt;/strong&gt;pour rejoindre les équipes Data Factory.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cette plateforme technologique, globale à tout le groupe de manière internationale, soutient le développement de l’usage de la Data chez Decathlon, du calcul du chiffre d’affaires à l’aide de conception de produits innovants.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous opérons une Modern Data Stack de pointe, avec un Lakehouse comme centre de gravité. Notre mission ? Garantir la scalabilité, l&#39;automatisation et l&#39;excellence des pratiques de développement pour l&#39;ensemble de nos communautés (Data Engineers, Analysts, Scientists).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ton futur terrain de jeu&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;La Data Factory est organisée en équipes expertes, chacune pilotée par un binôme Tech Lead &amp;amp; Product Manager. Selon ton profil et tes affinités, tu intégreras l’un de nos collectifs :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🎨 Équipe UserXP (User Experience)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tu es l&#39;interface entre la plateforme et ses utilisateurs. Ton rôle est de concevoir des outils et des workflows qui simplifient la vie des développeurs data, en mettant l&#39;accent sur l&#39;ergonomie et l&#39;efficacité opérationnelle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;📥 Équipe Ingestion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ton objectif : rendre l&#39;ingestion de données &quot;seamless&quot;. Tu développes et maintiens nos solutions internes (DFI - Data Factory Ingestion) pour garantir un flux de données fluide, normé et automatisé vers le datalake.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;STACK TECHNIQUE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un environnement full cloud (AWS-GCP)&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kubernetes, avec full CI/CD (Flux, Github Action...)&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;S3, Redshift, PostgreSQL, GCS, BigQuery&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;EMR, Databricks, AWS Athena&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Airflow&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Jira/Confluence, GitHub&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Langages : (au moins 2 parmi) : Python, Java, JavaScript/TypeScript&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frameworks/Librairies : React, Angular, Vue.js, Spring, Django, Flask, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TA FUTURE CONTRIBUTION&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tu seras en charge de:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Concevoir, développer et maintenir des composants front-end et back-end de la plateforme data, en mettant l&#39;accent sur l&#39;expérience développeur et l&#39;automatisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribuer à la mise en place d&#39;une plateforme data self-service, en fournissant des outils et des services qui simplifient le développement, le déploiement et l&#39;exploitation des solutions data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Développer des API et des services robustes et évolutifs pour l&#39;accès et la manipulation des données.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implémenter des interfaces utilisateur intuitives pour les outils et services de la plateforme data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automatiser les processus de développement, de test et de déploiement (CI/CD) pour garantir une livraison rapide et fiable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborer étroitement avec les équipes Data Science, Data Engineering et Ops pour comprendre leurs besoins et y répondre efficacement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participer à la veille technologique et proposer des solutions innovantes pour améliorer la plateforme data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apprendre et appliquer les bonnes pratiques de développement logiciel, de test et de documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DECATHLON DIGITAL&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Imaginez si la technologie nous permettait de repousser les frontières et d&#39;offrir des expériences sportives inédites. C&#39;est précisément notre ambition chez Decathlon Digital ! Nous sommes une équipe de plus de 5 000 experts en ingénierie logicielle, gestion de produits, données, cloud et cybersécurité, répartis à Paris, Lille et Amsterdam. Ensemble, nous créons la plus vaste plateforme sportive numérique, en exploitant les innovations technologiques pour optimiser la chaîne de valeur, concevoir des expériences connectées et donner une seconde vie à nos produits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Changeons la donne pour de bon.&lt;/strong&gt; Notre passion du sport nous guide et nous voulons qu’elle perdure. C’est pourquoi nous nous engageons à bâtir un modèle technologique plus durable, en réduisant notre impact direct sur l&#39;environnement, et en créant un espace sûr et inclusif pour apprendre et nous épanouir ensemble. Rejoins l’équipe et façonnons le futur du sport.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h3 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;🧡&lt;strong&gt; About Alma&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;At Alma, we believe sustainable commerce depends on fair, well‑balanced trade. Because finance plays a pivotal role in business, our mission is to put it back in its rightful place - serving merchants and consumers. Our installment and deferred payment solutions help merchants boost sales by 20% or more, increase customer loyalty, and deliver a seamless shopping experience - without encouraging bad debt. As the buy now pay later leader in France and active in 10 European countries, we&#39;ve empowered over +25,000 merchants and 10 million consumers. With 400+ Almakers and €100M+ ARR, Alma is scaling rapidly across Europe as a member of the Next40, and we&#39;re just getting started!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;👐&lt;strong&gt; About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;Alma Wallet builds the payment experience of the Alma app. With the Alma card, consumers can pay with Alma anywhere, not only at our partner merchants. In the app, they manage their payments with the method of their choice: Apple Pay, Google Pay or local payment methods. By taking Alma beyond our merchant network, the Alma card is one of the company&#39;s key strategic bets. You will report to &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/in/tony-miksa/&quot;&gt;Tony&lt;/a&gt;, Senior Engineering Manager, and work closely with Justine, Product Manager, to bring it to life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;This position is a CDI based in Paris, with a hybrid work model.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;💼&lt;strong&gt; About the job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deliver the Alma Wallet roadmap: &lt;/strong&gt;the Alma card, and bringing new payment methods (Apple Pay, Google Pay, local payment methods), identity verification and Open Banking to the mobile app.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead and grow the Alma Wallet squad&lt;/strong&gt; by supporting engineers’ development, hiring the right profiles and creating an environment where the team can do its best work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build an effective delivery system&lt;/strong&gt; by improving team processes, rituals and collaboration with Product, Design and the other Consumer squads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deliver a strategic payment roadmap&lt;/strong&gt; covering the Alma card, Apple Pay and Google Pay, local payment methods, the consumer point-of-sale experience, identity verification and Open Banking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Raise the technical bar and protect reliability&lt;/strong&gt; through code reviews, technical design discussions and a strong focus on the quality and resilience of payment flows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;🧰&lt;strong&gt; You will work with&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Mobile&lt;/em&gt;: Expo / EAS, React Native, TypeScript, TanStack Query, Redux Toolkit, Zod, Reanimated, Jest, Detox. Payment SDKs: Adyen, Stripe, &lt;a href=&quot;http://Checkout.com&quot;&gt;Checkout.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Back-end&lt;/em&gt;: Python, FastAPI, SQLAlchemy, PostgreSQL, Redis, Pub/Sub.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Infra &amp;amp; observability&lt;/em&gt;: GCP, Kubernetes, Docker, ArgoCD, Datadog, Sentry, OpenFeature.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Tools&lt;/em&gt;: GitHub, Linear, Notion, Figma.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;🧩&lt;strong&gt; About you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To succeed in this job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;You have 3+ years of experience managing or leading engineers, including hiring and supporting team development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;You have strong hands-on technical credibility in mobile or back-end engineering, and are comfortable reviewing code and leading architecture discussions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;You have experience delivering products in a cross-functional squad with Product and Design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;You are fluent in both French and English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;And it will be nice if you also&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Have experience in fintech or another regulated environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Have worked with payment methods, payment service providers or PSP SDK integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Have contributed to a consumer mobile application used at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Have mobile engineering experience, ideally with React Native.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Don&#39;t meet every single requirement? At Alma, we believe great hires come from diverse paths. If this role excites you, we encourage you to apply. We value potential, curiosity and the ability to grow as much as experience.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;🧘&lt;strong&gt; What&#39;s in it for you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;If you join, you will be able to grow and impact on:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape the Alma Wallet squad from the ground up&lt;/strong&gt;, helping define its ways of working, team culture and engineering practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own projects at the heart of Alma’s strategy&lt;/strong&gt;, including the Alma card, Apple Pay and Google Pay, local payment methods and the evolution of the consumer payment experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work on a modern, end-to-end product stack&lt;/strong&gt;, from Expo, React Native, React 19 and TypeScript 7 on mobile to Python and FastAPI on the back-end.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;🤑&lt;strong&gt; Compensation &amp;amp; benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Competitive salary based on 12 months&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Profit-sharing and employee savings plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Health insurance: 100% covered by Alma including family package&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Disability insurance: 100% covered by Alma&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Sport: partnerships with Gymlib and Classpass, or €30/month reimbursement for your sports activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Maternity/paternity leave: salary maintained at 100% during leave with no seniority requirement. Return to work at 4/5 schedule paid at 100% for 8 weeks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Sustainable Mobility Package (FMD): €544.80/year (excluding full-remote contracts)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Meal vouchers: €10/day, 50% covered by Alma&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Mental health: free access to MindDay platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Paid time off: 25 days/year (+ additional paid leave granted for employees on executive contracts)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Access to our Learning &amp;amp; Development Platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;2 weeks of full remote possible per year in summer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;🎯&lt;strong&gt; Interview Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Video screen with Sara, Talent Acquisition Manager&lt;/strong&gt; — 30–45 minutes to discuss your experience, motivation and the role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience interview with Tony Miksa, Hiring Manager&lt;/strong&gt; — 45 minutes to explore your management experience, technical background and fit with the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Coding test with a Software Engineering interviewer&lt;/strong&gt; — 45–90 minutes, depending on your main programming language.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;System design interview with a Staff Engineer interviewer&lt;/strong&gt; — 60 minutes to discuss architecture, technical trade-offs and reliability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Coffee chat with members of the Consumer tribe&lt;/strong&gt; — 60 minutes with a combination of Product and Engineering team members.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reference checks&lt;/strong&gt; — two professional references.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;🌍&lt;strong&gt; Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Alma, we believe that diversity fuels innovation and makes our community stronger. We are committed to building a workplace where every person feels seen, respected, and empowered to do their best work whatever their gender, background, ethnicity, age, sexual orientation, religion, disability or lived experience. As an equal opportunity employer, we welcome applicants from all walks of life, and all employment decisions are made based on qualifications, merit, and business needs.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;At Stark, we forge the future of European and national security through cutting-edge, AI-driven technology and unmatched engineering precision. As a premier defence technology company, our mission is clear: to equip NATO Allies and their partners &amp;nbsp;with next-generation autonomous defence platforms and advanced AI-driven software built to perform in the world’s most demanding environments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We believe that true security stems from relentless innovation. By combining elite engineering talent with agile technology and an AI-native operational culture, Stark turns complex defence challenges into field-tested, multi-domain solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline; font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;The software and systems you work on directly protect personnel and defend European and national sovereignty.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;You will work alongside industry-leading minds on autonomous systems, advanced propulsion, and secure cyber platforms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We foster a fast-paced, collaborative environment where bold ideas are supported by serious R&amp;amp;D backing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice-To-Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline; font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Equal Opportunity:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;At Stark Defence, we are committed to building a diverse, inclusive, and high-performing team. We operate in an industry where women, as well as other minority groups, are systematically under-represented. We actively encourage applications from candidates of all backgrounds and identities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;If you are excited about this role, we encourage you to apply even if you don&#39;t meet all the listed qualifications—ability and impact cannot be summarised in a few bullet points. We value unique perspectives, adaptability, and a drive to solve high-stakes challenges.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline; font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Security Clearance:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Due to the nature of our work in the defence sector, candidates must be eligible to obtain and maintain the appropriate security clearance required for this position. Details will be provided during the recruitment process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brief info about Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our mission is to make second-hand the first choice, and we&#39;re looking for people who want to help us get there. Every day, we work together to help our members buy and sell pre-loved clothing and lifestyle items, giving each piece a second life – or even a third. &lt;br&gt;The Vinted Group is made up of three business units that support this mission:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/marketplace&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Vinted Marketplace&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; is Europe’s leading platform for second-hand fashion and a go-to destination for all kinds of pre-loved items, with a growing range of categories. Our platform connects millions of members across 20+ markets, helping great items find a new life.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedgo&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Go&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; enhances the shipping experience with a vast network of over 500,000 pick-up and drop-off points, partnering with more than 60 carriers across Europe, with added services like item verification for peace of mind on high-value pieces.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedpay&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Pay&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is the newest part of the Vinted Group, dedicated to bringing secure, reliable payments to buyers and sellers across Europe. Seamlessly integrated into the Vinted app, it helps keep every transaction safe, efficient, and easy for our members.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Founded in 2008 in Lithuania, Vinted began as a way for friends to find new homes for clothes they no longer needed. In 2019, we became Lithuania&#39;s first unicorn! Today, our headquarters remain in Vilnius, and we&#39;ve grown with offices across Europe, supported by a team of over 2,000 people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Information about the position&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vinted Engineering is building an AI platform, and we need a &lt;strong&gt;Sr. TPM&lt;/strong&gt; to own it. AI tools are already in the hands of our engineers. Early signals are strong. What doesn&#39;t yet exist is a platform: a coherent, managed foundation that connects tooling, workflows, and measurement that every team can rely on.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role exists to build that. You&#39;ll set the strategy, influence the roadmap, drive delivery, and make AI impact visible through metrics that matter to the business - not vanity numbers. You&#39;ll work closely with engineering leadership, influence direction at the executive level, and be accountable for results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you want to build from scratch, own outcomes, and see your work become the foundation others build on - this is the role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this position, you’ll&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the cross-Engineering AI adoption strategy - setting outcome targets, building alignment across domains, and driving accountability for results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and build the measurement framework that makes AI impact visible - determining what to measure, making it visible and broadly understood across the organization, and using it to drive decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the delivery of an AI toolset, including standardized, pre-configured, and integrated into daily workflows, and run structured, data-driven trials to evaluate new tools with clear go/no-go criteria&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with engineering leaders across domains to move AI from optional to expected - PRs without AI assistance should be the exception, not the norm&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the platform is reliable and safe to scale by removing adoption blockers, setting code quality guardrails with Staff Engineers, and owning compliance and security&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage a portfolio of AI initiatives simultaneously, balancing pace and quality, and escalating risks and trade-offs clearly to leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant senior-level experience in technical program or project management, with a track record of owning complex, cross-functional programs end-to-end.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Software engineering or engineering management experience that gives you genuine technical credibility with the teams you&#39;ll work with&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A degree in computer science, software development, engineering, a related discipline, or equivalent practical experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on familiarity with AI-powered developer tools (e.g. Copilot, Cursor) and LLM-based workflows — you understand what they can and can&#39;t do in a real engineering environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A genuine bias for outcomes over outputs: you set success metrics before you start and measure relentlessly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of driving large, cross-functional programs to measurable results in fast-moving, complex organizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable leading in ambiguity and building the playbook, not just following one - this domain is new, and the mandate is broad&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ability to drive accountability across teams without direct authority, including at domain and engineering leadership levels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills - you can translate complex technical and data-driven narratives clearly for both engineering and executive audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with developer productivity metrics (DORA metrics or similar) is a strong plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inclined to aim high, take ownership, and move with urgency - this role has real visibility and real expectations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work perks&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to benefit from our share options programme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;30 days of paid annual leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Newest MacBook models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidential Employee Assistance Program (EAP) for you and your family&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home office support: we provide IT workstation equipment and a personal budget of up to €540 for home workplace furniture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lunch benefit per your workday&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frequent team-building events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A personal monthly budget for shopping on Vinted&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to a discounted gym membership plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension Plan with Vinted matching 150% of your chosen contribution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supplemental Private Health Insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life and Disability insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A subsidised Deutschlandticket for your commute to the office by public transport&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dog-friendly office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working at Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workation Policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Better balance holidays with workdays by working remotely! Up to 90 days per year in the EU, of these, 21 days can be spent globally. For non-EU citizens, it&#39;s 21 days worldwide. This can be combined with time off for vacation or personal time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Individual Learning Budget&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Each year, you’ll be given a learning budget (starting at €3,000), and a total of up to 10 working days over a 2-year period to support your personal and professional development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid Work&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our hybrid model, with 2 recommended office days a week, gives you and your team the flexibility to decide if and when you want to work from home, and when to catch up in person.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome applications from everybody, regardless of your background, identity, or life experiences. Job openings come with guides, not checklists.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We encourage all highly qualified candidates to apply, as exceptional experience and skills may offer opportunities for flexibility beyond the advertised role.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The annual gross salary range for this position is:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€102.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€166.880 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;We’re on a mission to become the go-to destination for students across Europe to find a trusted home away from home. We make every step of the rental journey simple and seamless, so students can focus on what really matters: studying, exploring, and growing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With HousingAnywhere, Kamernet, and Studapart under our roof, we’re Europe’s largest student rental platform. You’ll find us in Rotterdam, Paris, and Cergy, always guided by our four core values: Ownership, We are enablers, We are changemakers, and We are connectors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To support our continued growth, we are creating a new, strategic role at the heart of operational performance and customer experience. There is no Quality &amp;amp; Training activity in the Group today : you will build it from the ground up.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Quality &amp;amp; Training Manager, you will create and lead the Quality &amp;amp; Training activity for the whole HousingAnywhere Group, covering the Operations teams in Cergy and Rotterdam. You define its scope, methods and tools, and you are responsible for service quality and operational practices across the Group.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You work closely with the managers of the Customer Support and Booking Ops teams to structure training, onboarding, quality monitoring and performance tooling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role is based in France, with frequent travel to our Rotterdam office. English is the main working language.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Building the Quality &amp;amp; Training activity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design the Quality &amp;amp; Training activity : scope, operating model, priorities and roadmap,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set up the tools, rituals and governance needed to run the activity at Group level,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Harmonise quality and training practices between the Cergy and Rotterdam teams,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lay the foundations for the activity to grow as needs evolve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Training &amp;amp; onboarding&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify the training needs of the Ops teams, and accompany the integration process while migrating to a single operating model in 2027,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop complete training programmes covering customer service posture, tools, and day-to-day processes and procedures,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and maintain training materials (scripts, practical guides, process sheets, e-learning content), working with the other departments like Product for new features,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run a structured onboarding and support new joiners in live situations after initial training, to bridge theory and practice,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Carry out an individual assessment at the end of onboarding (audits, call listening, double listening, tests) and provide personalised follow-up,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead group and one-to-one sessions, on-the-spot debriefs and targeted coaching on the fundamentals: call handling, request qualification, rephrasing, quality of written and spoken answers, and CRM data entry,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Train teams on new procedures and tool changes as they are rolled out.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quality &amp;amp; operational performance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and roll out quality standards and control frameworks for each team, across the full user journey,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build structured quality reporting by individual, team and business unit, with a monthly report to managers,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse interactions, indicators and recurring errors to identify root causes and drive continuous improvement plans,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Knowledge management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with the Ops Project Manager to maintain the knowledge base,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a culture of knowledge sharing and self-learning (e-learning) to reduce reliance on informal mentoring.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-functional collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to Voice of Customer and customer satisfaction projects by sharing pain points identified through quality monitoring,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Propose initiatives to align operational practices with company strategy and the user experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise and support managers on using tools and analysing performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in training, quality management or quality monitoring of customer service or operations teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building a quality or training activity from scratch, or a strong drive to do so,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience setting up a quality monitoring programme (call listening, audits, calibration),&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid knowledge of customer service best practices and operational process management,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to analyse spoken and written interactions and turn them into concrete recommendations,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Teaching skills, structure and a results focus, with the ability to convince and motivate teams,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable with CRM and telephony tools, e-learning content creation and performance dashboards,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent English and French are required. English is the main working language,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel frequently to Rotterdam.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why this opportunity?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A newly created role: you build the Group&#39;s Quality &amp;amp; Training activity from the ground up.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Group-wide impact across our teams in Cergy and Rotterdam.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A high level of autonomy to design tools, processes and training materials.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An international environment, working between France and the Netherlands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A role combining training, quality and operations, both strategic and hands-on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s in it for you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Position based in our Cergy office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Executive status with 218 workdays/year (with RTT days off).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;50% transport costs covered.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;70% health insurance coverage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meal vouchers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribution to fitness membership costs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Christmas gift vouchers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team-building events and much more!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Read more about our France-based teams &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.welcometothejungle.com/en/companies/studapart&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Zürich (hybrid)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will lead Data &amp;amp; AI engagements for enterprise clients in Switzerland, with a focus on Financial Services, combining strong technical understanding with consulting and delivery leadership. Working closely with our teams in Switzerland, Poland, and India, you will help clients turn their Data &amp;amp; AI ambitions into practical solutions while contributing to new opportunities and the development of our Data &amp;amp; AI service line.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;flex-1 flex flex-col px-4 max-w-3xl mx-auto w-full pt-1&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-find-provider-scope=&quot;&quot;&gt;
