&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This is a senior consultant role. You don&#39;t just execute SEO - you steer clients toward the right strategy, challenge their assumptions when needed, and help them get there.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Own the client relationship on discoverability.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; You&#39;re the strategic sparring partner for marketing leads and digital directors. You advise, align, and drive decisions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
