&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;About the Role&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a highly skilled and motivated Senior Java / SAP Full Stack Developer to join our engineering team. In an environment where our SDLC is powered by cutting-edge AI tools (including generative AI for coding, testing, and documentation), your primary focus will shift from boilerplate implementation to high-level system architecture, critical evaluation of AI-generated code, and complex problem-solving across both Java cloud platforms and SAP ERP environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is for a developer who sees AI not as a replacement for skill, but as a force multiplier that demands greater judgment, technical depth, and prompt engineering expertise. Leveraging AI, you will work across the entire software development Lifecycle to enable connectivity into SAP ECC and S/4HANA systems—collaborating closely with product managers, designers, and other engineers to deliver high-quality, impactful solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-Enhanced Development &amp;amp; SAP Connectivity:&lt;/strong&gt; Design, develop, and maintain high-performance, scalable Java microservices (primarily using &lt;strong&gt;Spring Boot/Spring Framework&lt;/strong&gt;). Utilize AI coding assistants (e.g., GitHub Copilot, Claude Code, internal tools) to increase speed and offload repetitive tasks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Critical AI Code Review &amp;amp; Optimization:&lt;/strong&gt; Serve as the final technical authority on all AI-generated code. &lt;strong&gt;Rigorously review, debug, and optimize&lt;/strong&gt; suggested code for performance, security, and adherence to SAP Clean Core standards and enterprise design patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;System Architecture &amp;amp; Hybrid SAP Connectivity:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead the design and implementation of distributed connectivity components across hybrid &lt;strong&gt;SAP ECC and S/4HANA&lt;/strong&gt; estates, ensuring resilience, low latency, and clean data structures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prompt Engineering for SDLC:&lt;/strong&gt; Apply advanced &lt;strong&gt;prompt engineering&lt;/strong&gt; techniques to maximize the efficacy of generative AI tools for writing comprehensive unit/integration tests, drafting technical documentation (Javadoc, API specs), and generating code refactoring suggestions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CI/CD and Observability:&lt;/strong&gt; Oversee and enhance automated build, test, and deployment pipelines (&lt;strong&gt;CI/CD, Kubernetes/Docker&lt;/strong&gt;) in a cloud environment (&lt;strong&gt;AWS/Azure/GCP&lt;/strong&gt;), leveraging AI tools for proactive anomaly detection and monitoring.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Required Technical Qualifications&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5+ years&lt;/strong&gt; of professional experience in developing enterprise-level applications using &lt;strong&gt;Java (8+ / modern Java)&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proficiency&lt;/strong&gt; with the &lt;strong&gt;Spring Ecosystem&lt;/strong&gt; (Spring Boot, Spring Data, Spring Security).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of &lt;strong&gt;Object-Oriented Design (OOD)&lt;/strong&gt;, software design patterns, and &lt;strong&gt;Microservices architecture&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SAP Connectivity &amp;amp; Clean Core Architecture:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven experience building with &lt;strong&gt;SAP Clean Core principles&lt;/strong&gt; across both &lt;strong&gt;SAP ECC and S/4HANA&lt;/strong&gt; environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SAP Basis &amp;amp; Technical Integration Literacy:&lt;/strong&gt; Familiarity with SAP Basis administration concepts, system architecture, RFC connections, secure gateways, and system integration troubleshooting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong practical experience with &lt;strong&gt;concurrency and multithreading&lt;/strong&gt; in Java to build highly performant services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in modern DevOps practices, including &lt;strong&gt;Git, Docker, Kubernetes, and CI/CD pipelines (e.g., Jenkins, GitLab CI)&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of &lt;strong&gt;front-end technologies&lt;/strong&gt; such as HTML, CSS, JavaScript, TypeScript, and modern JavaScript frameworks (e.g., ReactJS, MobX).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with relational (&lt;strong&gt;PostgreSQL, MySQL&lt;/strong&gt;) and NoSQL databases (&lt;strong&gt;MongoDB, Redis&lt;/strong&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Essential AI-Era Skills (The &quot;New Bar&quot;)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Tool Fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated ability to proficiently use AI-powered developer tools (&lt;strong&gt;e.g., GitHub Copilot, CodeWhisperer&lt;/strong&gt;) in a production environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Code Judgment:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven track record of evaluating and overriding AI-generated suggestions that are technically correct but architecturally flawed or non-compliant with security and performance best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prompting Proficiency:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience writing clear, contextual, and effective prompts for generative AI to produce usable code, tests, or documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adaptability &amp;amp; Learning:&lt;/strong&gt; High degree of curiosity and a proactive approach to learning new AI tools and techniques that continuously reshape the development workflow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain &amp;amp; Architectural Focus:&lt;/strong&gt; The capacity to abstract away from low-level coding details to focus on &lt;strong&gt;high-value business logic and systemic architectural integrity.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cloud-First Mentality (AWS):&lt;/strong&gt; A strong bias towards cloud-first development, with specific expertise in architecture and deployment on Amazon Web Services (AWS).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Preferred Skills and Qualifications:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with message queues (e.g., Kafka, RabbitMQ).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of NoSQL databases (e.g., MongoDB, Cassandra).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of agile development methodologies (Scrum, Kanban)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with test-driven development (TDD) or behavior-driven development (BDD).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in the automation or SaaS industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributions to open-source projects or a strong GitHub portfolio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation package, comprehensive health, dental, and vision benefits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to work on innovative and impactful products that are transforming industries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous paid time off, holidays and flexible work arrangements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with a highly skilled, passionate, and diverse&amp;nbsp; team of engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
